         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The NCP4307 is high performance driver tailored to control a synchronous rectification MOSFET in switch mode power supplies. Thanks to its high performance drivers and versatility, it can be used in various topologies such as DCM or CCM flyback, quasi resonant flyback and forward.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
